# Copy to .env (development: project root; release build: next to the exe).
# The app reads only the named variables below; it never imports the whole
# file. Keys never reach logs, the database, or the UI.
#
# Automatic chat title service (optional; a fallback title is kept without it):
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
#
# The OpenRouter key is NOT read from here: configure it in the app's
# "Models" panel. On Windows it is stored DPAPI-encrypted for the current
# user in data\credentials.dpapi.
